		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Nimble, prancing, rag- wrapped elven humanoids.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 5, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger (close/near) +3 (1d4 + poison) or dancer's curse, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dancer's Curse</strong>. Touch one target. WIS 15+ or cursed, DISADV on DEX checks. Repeat check once per day; ends on success.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dark Dweller</strong>. Blinded in bright light. Evaporate in a burst of bright light when reduced to 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d4 DEX damage, paralyzed at 0 DEX.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
